      "category": "safety",
      "title": "Recall: Front Seat Recliner Assembled Without Internal Lock (2019-2020 Ka Hatch)",
      "description": "In September/October 2019, Ford Brazil recalled Ka Hatch model-year 2019 vehicles (manufactured October 10, 2018 to June 1, 2019) and model-year 2020 vehicles (manufactured February 18 to September 19, 2019), together with the EcoSport, because the manual seat-back reclining mechanism of the front seats may have been assembled missing one of its three internal locks. In a rear collision, the absence of one lock can reduce the seat-back's locking force and fail to adequately retain occupants, increasing the risk of injury. Free inspections began October 14, 2019, and the campaign was registered with Procon-SP.",
      "solution": "Take the vehicle to a Ford dealership for free inspection of both front seat recliner mechanisms and replacement of the recliner assembly if a lock is missing. Check chassis eligibility via Ford Brazil's recall lookup (ford.com.br) or customer service at 0800 703 3673.",
